# The PS5 WebView caches aggressively, and a mixed new app.js + stale
# style.css once left the kernel stage rendering in the old pre-wrap layout
# (blank rows between "[*] Kernel: ..." lines, then a test showed them as
# inset). Force revalidation on everything the run reads live so a redeploy
# is never half-old on the console; if-unmodified stays cheap thanks to the
# platform ETags.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex